{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066237/block/singleImage/3280936/df/01M8GEKXWYAG7XS4AHQ8D9HH4Z.jpg?updatedAt=1795850713\"/><figcaption>屯門建發里一幢工業大廈外牆棚架起火。(真. 屯門友Facebook)</figcaption></figure><p>今日（28日）下午2時許，警方及消防接獲多個報案，指屯門建發里一幢工業大廈外牆棚架起火。 從網上影片可見，棚架陷火海，火光熊熊，濃煙席捲半空；消防正向火場射水。消防接報趕抵現場，出動用煙帽隊灌救。現場亦有一輛救護車到場戒備，起火原因有待調查。</p><p>在 Threads 查看</p><p>在 Threads 查看</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:47:10.655132+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:51:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:34.015300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:34.015300+00:00","content_hash":"aac13b161098113551b7e8fd8b6ee8804160483ef07b27f9c44ed39a808f985f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}